the area proposed to be annexed, noting there was an affiliated zone change ordinance in conjunction
with annexation.  He stated requirements and compliance of annexation conditions contained in state
statutes had been met.  There being no further comments or input and purpose of the hearing having
been met, Mayor Kaysen closed the public hearing.
